  "house": [
    "Animate Dead is a 3rd-level spell for Kaldaran — DM approved. By the book it's 4th, and Mystic Past Life can't legally grant it since every class with it at 3rd is divine.",
    "Cantrips are unlimited. (By the book you prepare 4 a day and those 4 can be cast at will — the house part is only that I do not have to pick which 4.)",
    "Wand of Magic Missile regains 5 charges per day, max 20.",
